{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32122","headline":"生禖屏风歌 · 温庭筠","name":"生禖屏风歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉墀暗接昆仑井，井上无人金索冷。\n画壁阴森九子堂，阶前细月铺花影。\n绣屏银鸭香蓊蒙，天上梦归花绕丛。\n宜男漫作後庭草，不似樱桃千子红。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32122.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32122","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}